    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d60">

                <pb facs="0069" n="57" sameAs="frus:frus1943v05/pg57"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">033.1110 Wallace, Henry A./128f: Circular
                    telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to Certain Diplomatic
                        Representatives in the American Republics</hi><anchor n="6" xml:id="d60-f1"
                    /></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-03-05T22:00:00-04:00">March 5, 1943—10 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The itinerary of the Vice President is as follows: <table cols="4"
                        rendition="#nowrap" rows="54">
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Costa
                                Rica</hi></cell>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Wednesday</cell>
                            <cell>March 17</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Leave Miami</cell>
                            <cell role="num">6:15 a.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Arrive Balboa</cell>
                            <cell role="num">12:50 p.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Thursday</cell>
                            <cell>March 18</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Leave Balboa</cell>
                            <cell role="num">9:30 a.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Arrive San José</cell>
                            <cell role="num">11:20 a.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Panama</hi></cell>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Sunday</cell>
                            <cell>March 21</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Leave San José</cell>
                            <cell role="num">12:45 p.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Arrive David</cell>
                            <cell role="num">3:00 p.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Monday</cell>
                            <cell>March 22</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Leave David</cell>
                            <cell role="num">3:15 p.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Arrive Balboa, C.Z. (Panama
                                City)</cell>
                            <cell role="num">4:45 p.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <pb facs="0070" n="58" xml:id="pg58"/>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Chile</hi></cell>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Wednesday</cell>
                            <cell>March 24</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Leave Balboa</cell>
                            <cell role="num">1:15 p.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Arrive Cali, Colombia (En route to
                                Santiago)</cell>
                            <cell role="num">4:30 p.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Thursday</cell>
                            <cell>March 25</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Leave Cali</cell>
                            <cell role="num">7:30 a.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Arrive Lima, Peru (En route to
                                Santiago)</cell>
                            <cell role="num">4:15 p.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Friday</cell>
                            <cell>March 26</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Leave Lima</cell>
                            <cell role="num">5:30 a.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Arrive Santiago, Chile</cell>
                            <cell role="num">5:35 p.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Friday</cell>
                            <cell>April 2</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Leave Santiago</cell>
                            <cell role="num">6:45 a.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Arrive Antofagasta</cell>
                            <cell role="num">11:20 a.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bolivia</hi></cell>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Sunday</cell>
                            <cell>April 4</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Leave Antofagasta</cell>
                            <cell role="num">11:35 a.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Arrive Arequipa (En route to La
                                Paz)</cell>
                            <cell role="num">2:10 p.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Monday</cell>
                            <cell>April 5</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Leave Arequipa</cell>
                            <cell role="num">8:45 a.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Arrive La Paz</cell>
                            <cell role="num">12:45 p.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Thursday</cell>
                            <cell>April 8</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Leave La Paz</cell>
                            <cell role="num">11:50 a.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Arrive Oruro</cell>
                            <cell role="num">12:40 p.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Friday</cell>
                            <cell>April 9</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Leave Oruro</cell>
                            <cell role="num">1:00 p.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Arrive Cochabamba</cell>
                            <cell role="num">1:35 p.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Saturday</cell>
                            <cell>April 10</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Leave Cochabamba</cell>
                            <cell role="num">11:00 a.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Arrive La Paz</cell>
                            <cell role="num">11:40 a.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Peru</hi></cell>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Saturday</cell>
                            <cell>April 10</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Leave La Paz</cell>
                            <cell role="num">11:50 a.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Arrive Lima</cell>
                            <cell role="num">3:55 p.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Ecuador</hi></cell>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Thursday</cell>
                            <cell>April 15</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Leave Lima</cell>
                            <cell role="num">6:30 a.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Arrive Guayaquil (Ecuador) (En route
                                to Quito)</cell>
                            <cell role="num">12:05 p.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Leave Guayaquil</cell>
                            <cell role="num">12:20 p.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Arrive Quito</cell>
                            <cell role="num">1:40 p.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Monday</cell>
                            <cell>April 19</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Leave Quito</cell>
                            <cell role="num">7:45 a.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Arrive Guayaquil</cell>
                            <cell role="num">10:00 a.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Colombia</hi></cell>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Tuesday</cell>
                            <cell>April 20</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Leave Guayaquil</cell>
                            <cell role="num">12:25 p.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Arrive Cali, Colombia (En route to
                                Bogotá)</cell>
                            <cell role="num">3:25 p.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Leave Cali</cell>
                            <cell role="num">4:00 p.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Arrive Bogotá</cell>
                            <cell role="num">5:25 p.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Thursday</cell>
                            <cell>April 22</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Leave Bogotá</cell>
                            <cell role="num">7:45 a.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Arrive Cali</cell>
                            <cell role="num">9:10 a.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Friday</cell>
                            <cell>April 23</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Leave Cali</cell>
                            <cell role="num">11:45 a.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Arrive Medellin</cell>
                            <cell role="num">1:35 p.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <pb facs="0071" n="59" xml:id="pg59"/>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Return</hi></cell>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Saturday</cell>
                            <cell>April 24</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Leave Medellin</cell>
                            <cell role="num">11:30 a.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Arrive Balboa</cell>
                            <cell role="num">2:15 p.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Leave Balboa</cell>
                            <cell role="num">2:35 p.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Arrive Miami</cell>
                            <cell role="num">11:00 p.m.</cell>
                        </row>
                    </table></p>
                <p>All flights will be made by commercial plane.</p>
                <p>A separate telegram<anchor n="7" xml:id="d60-f2"/> follows with respect to
                    suggestions of visits Mr. Wallace would like to make.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Welles</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d60-f1" n="6" type="source" xml:id="d60-f1-content">
                <p>The Ambassadors in Panama, Chile, Bolivia, Peru, Ecuador, and Colombia and the
                    Minister in Costa Rica.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d60-f2" n="7" xml:id="d60-f2-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
</TEI>
